{"input": "Summarize the whole meeting.", "answers": ["Firstly, User Interface suggested trendy and one-color cases, good icons on the big buttons since they would be recognizable and excite the young people. Secondly, Industrial Designer introduced that young people favored soft materials and primary colors, but trendy design on the button and the use of LCD display would increase cost since the budget had always been a big problem. Moreover, the team would aim at the younger market based on the decision of the former meeting and agreed that to make the device more profitable they should sell the product for longer than one year. The team also discussed the button function of the remote control but they had not come to an agreement. Lastly, Project Manager decided on a normal battery and no kinetic to control the budget."], "length": 6026, "dataset": "qmsum", "pred": "The meeting discussed the design of a remote control for a company. The team brainstormed ideas for the design, including colors, shapes, and features. They decided on a yellow case with rounded edges and buttons. The interface concept was discussed, including the use of buttons, scroll wheels, and a menu. The team also considered the cost of the remote control and the use of an LCD screen. They decided to create two concepts: one with an LCD screen and one without. The team agreed to paint the concepts and present them at the next meeting."}
